WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.470
- Wait, so what was
your ride or die moment?

00:00:02.470 --> 00:00:06.500
- Oh gosh, this is a little
bit of a tear-jerker moment,

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.650
but I had breast cancer
about six years ago now,

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:14.700
and this one summoned me
in the middle of treatment

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:18.619
to the Four Seasons where she
was using as her Starbucks.

00:00:18.619 --> 00:00:19.452
(ladies giggle)

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:20.285
We didn't have any money
- I wasn't welcome there.

00:00:20.285 --> 00:00:21.410
- We didn't have any money,

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:22.780
she would take a table

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:24.877
and just order sparkling water,

00:00:24.877 --> 00:00:26.460
(ladies giggle)
and answer emails.

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:28.570
So she said, "Meet me
at the Four Seasons",

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:30.587
and I showed up,
- I love this.

00:00:30.587 --> 00:00:32.880
- I said, "Listen," I go, "June,"

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:34.690
and I don't know why I felt like June

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:36.370
was the authority on my health

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:38.899
when I had some very good doctors,

00:00:38.899 --> 00:00:40.480
(audience laughs)
but, I said, "June,

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:42.470
do you think I'm gonna make it?"

00:00:42.470 --> 00:00:44.360
And she goes, just like regally,

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:45.389
she probably was in a blazer.

00:00:45.389 --> 00:00:46.222
(lady giggles)
She goes,

00:00:46.222 --> 00:00:48.900
"Oh, I have no question
you're gonna make it.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:52.100
What I'm interested in
is your mental health,

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:54.990
so I'm gonna-", and I feel
like she took out a Rolodex,

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:56.250
I know that wasn't true,

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:57.860
but she was like, "I'm gonna send

00:00:57.860 --> 00:00:59.840
a multitude of healers to you."

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:01.480
And I said, "What?"

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:03.207
Cut to, ding dong.

00:01:03.207 --> 00:01:05.690
"I'm gonna lay hands on
you. My name's Ethan."

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:06.523
(ladies laugh)

00:01:06.523 --> 00:01:08.497
"I need to sage your house."

00:01:08.497 --> 00:01:09.590
"I do witchcraft."

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:11.080
I was like, "Wait, what?"

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:12.893
And that's what she did for me,

00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:16.780
and I don't know what it is,

00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:17.747
when you ask your best friend,

00:01:17.747 --> 00:01:18.870
"Do you think I'm gonna be okay?"

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:20.570
And they say, "Yes" and you believe them,

00:01:20.570 --> 00:01:22.690
it really did give me the courage,

00:01:22.690 --> 00:01:24.120
to get through the rest of it,
(audience clapping)

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:25.424
and know I'm gonna be okay,

00:01:25.424 --> 00:01:26.573
and I am.

00:01:26.573 --> 00:01:27.406
- [Kelly] Absolutely.

00:01:27.406 --> 00:01:28.239
(audience cheers)
- I mean, look.

00:01:28.239 --> 00:01:29.330
- She is. Better than ever.

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:31.400
- Better than ever.
- Okay?

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:32.233
- And listen.

00:01:32.233 --> 00:01:33.500
- Better than ever.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:35.520
- When you send over 20 healers,

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:37.140
they're not all gonna be great.

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:38.095
- They weren't all great.
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:38.095 --> 00:01:39.382
- Some are gonna be weird.

00:01:39.382 --> 00:01:40.240
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:42.146
Yeah, it's just the numbers
aren't gonna always work out.

00:01:42.146 --> 00:01:43.290
- (laughs) The numbers are against you,

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:45.377
but someone will work out.

